## TECHNICAL SUMMARY

**Stack:** Next.js 16 + React 19 + TypeScript 5 + Tailwind CSS v4 + Sanity CMS  
**Styling:** Tailwind + shadcn/ui components with brand color system  
**Fonts:** Self-hosted RoobertPRO custom font (4 weights)  
**Analytics:** PostHog, Sentry error tracking  
**CMS:** Sanity (images from cdn.sanity.io)  
**Carousel:** Embla Carousel with autoplay  
**Animation:** Framer Motion  
**Deployment:** Standalone output mode  
**Brand Colors:** Navy (#092245), Cyan (#21cfff), Blue (#019ae6), Yellow (#FFEB85)
